    <!-- no 0-rpm row: below 2640 rpm FGTable holds that row, so the turbine breaks the rotor gear's static friction -->
    <!-- 6897 rpm = N2 max 104.5 % [B] Fig 5-1, zero power there (chosen) so a declutched turbine cannot run away -->
